---
description: >-
  Two components on one row joined by a relationship whose label is wider
  than the default gap. The gap widens so the label sits between the boxes
  instead of running through the right-hand one (#8419).
---
C4Component
title Same-row relationship label
Container_Boundary(worker, "Worker") {
  Component(group, "Grouping", "events/group", "Turns reports into facts and attaches them to a story")
  Component(digest, "Digest", "events/digest", "Rewrites the story summary after grouping")
}
Rel(group, digest, "enqueue events.digest after a 60s debounce")
